  <div class="left"><div class="blog-image">

                            <img class="blog-image-img" src="https://www.soccertipsters.com/images/contentMart/6b884ce4d41109f74c3221a75e0e71e8.png" />

                        </div>

                        

                        <span class="blog-tag">

                        <li><a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-category/15/betting-guide.html">Betting Guide</a> </li> <li><a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-category/124/betting-odds.html">Betting Odds</a> </li>

                        </span>

                        <div class="h1">Why the Odds You Get Matter as Much as the Tip | Soccertipsters</div>

                        <span class="blog-date">September 08,2026</span>
						<span class="blog-author">by <a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-author/5/bruce-williams.html">Bruce Williams</a></span>

                        <p>

                        The same soccer tip can produce very different results at different odds. Learn why price, line shopping and odds movement are critical to long-term betting returns.

                        </p>

                        <a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-detail/406/why-the-odds-you-get-matter-as-much-as-the-tip-soccertipsters.html" class="readmore">Read More <i class="fa fa-caret-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>

                        

                    </div>  <div class="right"><div class="blog-image">

                            <img class="blog-image-img" src="https://www.soccertipsters.com/images/contentMart/aa25a14aad641fc665444cae72a02ef8.png" />

                        </div>

                        

                        <span class="blog-tag">

                        <li><a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-category/15/betting-guide.html">Betting Guide</a> </li> <li><a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-category/16/betting-help.html">Betting Help</a> </li>

                        </span>

                        <div class="h1">The Problem With Betting Units: Can Tipster Records Be Manipulated? | Soccertipsters</div>

                        <span class="blog-date">September 02,2026</span>
						<span class="blog-author">by <a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-author/4/jake-woodward.html">Jake Woodward</a></span>

                        <p>

                        Tipsters often advertise profits in units, but the numbers can be misleading. Learn how inconsistent staking, selective reporting and changing unit sizes can distort betting records.

                        </p>

                        <a href="https://www.soccertipsters.com/blog-detail/405/the-problem-with-betting-units-can-tipster-records-be-manipulated-soccertipsters.html" class="readmore">Read More <i class="fa fa-caret-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>

                        

